{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>This game is a Kongming-inspired construction scoring game where you can put your heart and soul into building powerful pieces to win.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Each game will be a new layout, and of course you can unlock different game packs to get a new experience by winning, and you can earn enough to meet the requirements of each tier until you win.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>A combination of wisdom and luck (you may have to count a few moves later)</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Different Difficulty, Different Bags - Each win unlocks a new difficulty and a new bag to give you a new experience</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">5 different card packs, 3 different difficulties, and a mess that brings together all the cards</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Make use of the help items that the game gives you, using scramble and movement to break up the situation.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">I hope you find joy in the game.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3578590?t=1741862036","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3578590?t=1741862036","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3578590/54c263bcd09dd909f7edaef1d8dce03c3e7d0cf0/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1741862036","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3578590/54c263bcd09dd909f7edaef1d8dce03c3e7d0cf0/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1741862036","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>This game is a Kongming-inspired construction scoring game where you can put your heart and soul into building powerful pieces to win.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Each game will be a new layout, and of course you can unlock different game packs to get a new experience by winning, and you can earn enough to meet the requirements of each tier until you win.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>A combination of wisdom and luck (you may have to count a few moves later)</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Different Difficulty, Different Bags - Each win unlocks a new difficulty and a new bag to give you a new experience</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">5 different card packs, 3 different difficulties, and a mess that brings together all the cards</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Make use of the help items that the game gives you, using scramble and movement to break up the situation.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">I hope you find joy in the game.</p>","developers":["AliveGames"],"genres":[{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3578590/3c7dac8f8752f9db2cea15316e2816de2c95612c/header.jpg?t=1741862036","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"highlight":true,"id":257111001,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257111001/movie480.mp4?t=1741862035","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257111001/movie_max.mp4?t=1741862035"},"name":"\u73a9\u6cd5\u89c6\u9891","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257111001/c70215651c05c717f1bc7227c41c977e2396ef1b/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1741862035","webm":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257111001/movie480_vp9.webm?t=1741862035","max":"http://video.akama